{"id":"ten_","lemma":"тень","pos":"noun","rank":1487,"glosses":["shade","shadow","vestige, particle, atom, hint"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/af/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"тени","plural":"тени"},"examples":[{"text":"Оставайся в тени.","en":"Keep in the shade.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/727904","words":[{"g":"to remain, to stay","l":"оставаться"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Нет света без тени.","en":"There's no light without a shadow.","words":[{"g":"no / there isn't"},{"g":"light","l":"свет"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Пойдём сядем в тень.","en":"Let's go sit in the shade.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"},{"g":"to sit down","l":"сесть"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Он собственной тени боится.","en":"He is afraid of his own shadow.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null,{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"}]},{"text":"Давайте попробуем найти какую-нибудь тень.","en":"Let's try and find some shade.","words":[{"g":"to let"},{"g":"to test","l":"попробовать"},{"g":"to find"},null,null,null]}]}